  "executive_briefing": "The cryptocurrency market is transitioning from speculative retail cycles to institutional-grade infrastructure deployment, anchored by the legislative momentum of the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act. This regulatory framework is effectively formalizing Bitcoin\u2019s role as both a primary reserve asset and a programmable settlement layer, forcing a re-evaluation of Ethereum\u2019s EVM monopoly. As the initial excitement surrounding spot Bitcoin ETFs matures into steady-state treasury integration, the focus has shifted toward the technical frontier: building trust-minimized, non-custodial cross-chain interoperability to bridge liquidity between Bitcoin\u2019s burgeoning native smart-contract ecosystem and the established EVM landscape.",
